abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for artificial neural network experiments that
  evaluate binary intrusion detection and attack-family classification using
  CSE-CIC-IDS2018 for model development and CIC-IDS2017 for independent
  cross-dataset validation. The repository includes integrity manifests,
  dataset audit and cleaning scripts, fixed partition specifications,
  training-only preprocessing, feature mappings, model-training and evaluation
  scripts, environment files, and reported result artifacts.
